#. [component.Widget.percentageOfDaysWithServiceInterruptionDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The percentage of "device-days" that were statused as "down for repair", excluding weekends. For example, 20 weekdays in the month and 5 devices would equate 100 "device-days". If one device was down half of the month, this number would be 10%
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The percentage of \"device-days\" that were statused as \"down for repair\", "
"excluding weekends. For example, 20 weekdays in the month and 5 devices "
"would equate 100 \"device-days\". If one device was down half of the month, "
"this number would be 10%"
msgstr ""
"Відсоток \"днів-пристроїв\", які були визначені як \"недоступні для ремонту"
"\", за винятком вихідних. Наприклад, 20 робочих днів у місяці та 5 пристроїв "
"дорівнювали б 100 \"пристроям-дням\". Якби на одному пристрої було менше "
"половини місяця, це число становило б 10%"

#. [component.Widget.deviceCalibratedWhenDueDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The percentage of calibrations that were within 30 days of the scheduled date. Note that this only counts calibrations for devices that had a calibration record before.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The percentage of calibrations that were within 30 days of the scheduled "
"date. Note that this only counts calibrations for devices that had a "
"calibration record before."
msgstr ""
"Відсоток калібрувань, які були протягом 30 днів із запланованої дати. "
"Зверніть увагу, що це враховує калібрування лише для пристроїв, які раніше "
"мали запис калібрування."

#. [component.Widget.gxPositiveResultsNotifiedDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The percentage of positive GeneXpert's results that were notified via SMS or email.
#: extracted_strings.json
