"Введене ім’я користувача вже використовується іншим користувачем системи"

#. [component.Widget.utilizationRateDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The utilization rate is calculated by counting all tests conducted in the month and dividing that number by the total capacity of all devices. This calculation excludes weekends.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The utilization rate is calculated by counting all tests conducted in the "
"month and dividing that number by the total capacity of all devices. This "
